        "faq_item_JGVK6X": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "name": "Returns & Orders",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I modify my knife?",
            "answer": "It's your knife, but understand that modifications can affect your warranty.\n\nDamage caused by grinding, reshaping, drilling, improper sharpening or other aftermarket modifications isn't a manufacturing defect.\n\nIf you're considering doing something major to the knife and aren't sure how it'll affect the warranty, shoot us an email first.",
